<h1>Using the ucs2charstring class</h1>

<ul>
  <li><a href="#intro">Introduction</a></li>
  <li><a href="#manip">Manipulating UCS-2 Character Strings</a></li>
  <li><a href="#comp">Comparing UCS-2 Character Strings</a></li>
  <li><a href="#find">Finding Data in UCS-2 Character Strings</a></li>
  <li><a href="#trans">Transforming UCS-2 Character Strings</a></li>
  <li><a href="#parsing">Parsing UCS-2 Character Strings</a></li>
